	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r22_poke5_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンは　どうろの　さきへ
はしりさって　しまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T03:26:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンは　道路の　先へ
走り去ってしまった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T03:26:37" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T11:43:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・戦闘後
・倒した場合のメッセージ
・復帰処理の仕様は保留</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-19T03:29:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE5
ポケモン・テラキオン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
